Stops @gorhom/bottom-sheet from animating its content mask's height and
bottom padding. BottomSheetContent returned a new animate() for both on
every frame of a drag (the padding follows the sheet position), and on the
Huawei phone (Android 10) the animated height fell far below its target for
a few hundred ms. The mask clips the content and the background, so the
lower part of the map's page sheet was not painted and the map and tab bar
showed through on a slow drag down from full screen. Setting the values
directly keeps the mask at its target (phone capture series 2026-11-28).
No upstream fix; check the patch against each new gorhom release.
ThirdPlace ledger TP-PHASE0-FE-0576.

